**B) Non-Documentable Claims (Noise):**

* **"Crazy friend":** The expression must be interpreted as affectionate jargon/a pet name, not a medical assessment of Epstein''s mental health.
* **Attendance at Lunch:** It is *not documented* in the available material whether the Crown Princess actually accepted the lunch invitation with Elon Musk, only that the offer was made.

**C) Nature of the Relationship:**
The Crown Princess displays a demanding side ("What do you have to do besides seeing me ??????"). The use of six question marks indicates she expected to be the center of his attention. Epstein balances this by mentioning other commitments and high-profile meetings (Musk), thereby maintaining his status.

