2. **The Rød-Larsen Connection:** That Epstein forwarded emails to Rød-Larsen can be used to construct a theory that Rød-Larsen was a "handler" or had an oversight function over the Crown Princess''s contact with Epstein.
3. **"Salivating":** Nikolic''s comment can be falsely attributed to Epstein or used to claim that an actual sexual relationship existed, even though in the text it appears as "boys'' talk" between third parties.

**Assessment:**
The material confirms a **serious security risk**. Epstein distributed the Crown Princess''s private thoughts to third parties (Rød-Larsen) without her knowledge. Furthermore, the Crown Princess was aware that Epstein surrounded himself with young Norwegian women (24/25 years old) in a context he himself called a "wife hunt," without this leading to a break in the relationship. This indicates a normalization of deviant behavior within this social circle.

