**A) Verifiable Findings (Signal):**

* **Physical presence in private sphere:** The sentence "**Im working out in yr gym**" [EFTA00951351] is irrefutable evidence that the Crown Princess moved freely inside Epstein''s private facilities in Palm Beach, without his immediate supervision ("will call u after").
* **Medical intervention:** Epstein acts as a quack/physician by suggesting a specific 12-week course of antidepressants ("anti depressants") for smoking cessation and lifestyle change [EFTA00951173]. He also pressures her to use his American doctors over European ones.
* **"The Sacred Space":** Epstein''s description of his home as "**my sacred meditation space.. it is white and very pure**" [EFTA00951173] is a critical signal of how he manipulated the perception of the location. This stands in total contrast to the house''s actual function as a crime scene.

**B) Non-verifiable Claims (Noise):**

