This latest update to the analysis includes 10 documents that add crucial nuance to the case. For the first time, we see H.K.H. the Crown Princess set a clear ethical boundary with Jeffrey Epstein ("It makes me feel uncomfortable"), while simultaneously confirming a deep feeling of peace in his home. The material also contains indications that Epstein attempted to use the Crown Princess to recruit staff ("new asst"), and confirms the logistics surrounding helicopter transport.

