### 1. INTRODUCTION: THE FINAL LINKED ANALYSIS

This tenth and final analysis incorporates the last 10 documents in the "EVIDENCE VAULT." The material contains what is arguably the most important evidence in the case regarding H.K.H. Crown Princess''s intentions: A written desire to introduce Jeffrey Epstein to her husband, Crown Prince Haakon. Furthermore, the documents identify "Little E" as "Sarah" (likely Sarah Kellen), and operationally place her in Oslo.

