* **Summary:** Epstein asks the Crown Princess to coordinate directly with "**sarah**" (previously referred to as "my main asst little e" in the same thread). He writes: "**if you could email her directly and cooridnate with sarah your palm beach trip**". This connects known Epstein associate Sarah Kellen to the logistics surrounding the Crown Princess and confirms she was in Oslo.
